    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1361">

                <pb facs="0909" n="793" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg793"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/179.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Letcher.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 25, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In compliance with a request from the Spanish Embassy, renew your efforts to have
                    an investigation of the killing of the Gonzalez brothers. Impress with all
                    earnestness upon appropriate authorities the extreme importance of having this
                    action taken immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
